  "$comment": "Runtime Zod additionally checks canonical UTC instants, real CSL calendar dates, unique item ids, claim/version agreement, latest_version >= version, unchallenged-state consistency and an explicit omission when claim text is absent. These relational checks are not expressed by this Draft 2020-12 projection.",
